    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just... it feels so selfish. like, she's giving up her whole life to take care of me and deal with my moods and everything else. if i wasn't here, she could actually live again. she could travel, or just not be so exhausted all the time. it's like i'm stealing her future just so i can keep existing.",
